      "writtenOn": "2018-09-26T21:37:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have a code comment to that effect for sinks.  I haven\u0027t found an exception for hard resets in 2.7.3 or 5.7, though it\u0027s a big spec so it may be somewhere else. \n\nHard resets are listed in the AMS section, so I\u0027m tempted to say they would qualify as a time to set NG.",
      "parentUuid": "d28950bd_10d6786d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3738,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 3738,
